			},
			"date": "2022-11-12T20:44:29.757Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://techhub.social/@develwithoutacause\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>develwithoutacause</span></a></span> (subscribed and upvoted)</p><p>I don’t think it will do much until it’s natively available in the platform though right?</p>",
